# en ("a", "one", common gender) as the indefinite marker before a
# daypart: "en kold morgen i februar" ("one cold February morning") names
# no date.  en.wiktionary "en", Danish, Article: "a, an".  Every daypart
# noun is common gender (da.wiktionary "morgen": {{da-noun|en|morgen|...}}),
# so the neuter "et" is left out: it is also the clock hour one ("halv et
# om eftermiddagen" is 12:30).
en
